   "title": "Dependent or independent: $a_3$ in or out of the plane",
   "summary": "$a_3 = a_1 + a_2$ lies in the plane of $a_1, a_2$; replacing it by $(1, 0, 0)$ gives a basis of $\\mathbb{R}^3$.",
   "initial": {
    "title": "Two vectors",
    "tex": "a_1 = (2, 1, 5),\\quad a_2 = (4, 2, 0)",
